  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ut43Lym.png\" alt=\"標題\"></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&label=Discord&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/MarsThePlanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=MarsThePlanet&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Support me on Patreon\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/laser-bridges-doors\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/776337?color=F16436&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&label=Curseforge&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flaser-bridges-and-doors\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/laser-bridges-and-doors?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white&label=modrinth&color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> </strong></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5NxocZK.gif\" alt=\"\"> <br>此模組加入了具備未來風格的雷射橋樑、門與柵欄，當雷射源方塊受到紅石訊號激活時便會生成。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C17yBiD.gif\" alt=\"\"> <br>它們的長度取決於紅石訊號強度，並會即時動態更新。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VsMln86.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"411\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uFErCaY.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"411\"> <br>您可以手持染料點擊雷射源方塊來為其上色，或透過分配器施加染料。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VX4VIHg.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9qpoRLo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"411\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZ8J54O.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"411\"> <br>要合成雷射源方塊，請在合成格中放置一顆終界水晶，並於其四周放上玻璃方塊與 7 個鐵錠。您可以在合成格中放入一個雷射源方塊來合成雷射柵欄源方塊，此轉換方式可雙向進行。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>設定：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>您可以直接在遊戲內設定此模組，或編輯遊戲資料夾中的 JSON 檔案 <code>config/laserbridges.json</code>。若您使用的是 Fabric 並希望在遊戲內調整設定值，則需安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a>。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>show_next_level</strong> - 完全充能的雷射源方塊所能生成的雷射最大長度。其餘所有長度皆以此數值為基準進行計算，預設值為 15。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>blocks_cut_through_by_lasers</strong> - 可被雷射替換的方塊清單。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VMhMBQw.png\" height=\"400\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JNZ2GMV.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83sD0W8.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeimos\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2GIPnt.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/marstheplanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rJIRiP5.png\"></a></p>",
